      "message": "docs(site): macOS equivalents beside Windows-specific instructions\n\nShortcuts keep their Ctrl notation with a note on first-run that Cmd is\nthe key on macOS (the app binds them through egui's command modifier,\npanes.rs). Pages that name a shortcut or a click get the macOS form\nbeside it. The install page names the binaries and release files inside\nCamCraft.app and the macOS ZIP and DMG (scripts/package-macos.sh). The\ngates page names both gate wrappers and says cargo xtask gate is the\nsame on every OS.\n\nFixes #1236\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
